Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}意大利 乌尔比诺 公爵宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ducal Palace Urbino, Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.72,0:00:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大使先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}signore ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这真是失礼 贝多里先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really most humiliating signore bedoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下 我道歉 阁下 请您见谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord, prego, excellency, prego.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:00:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么事情如此重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could possibly be so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.83,0:01:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以至于我在早上7点前就得起床？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you dragged me from my bed before 7 o'clock in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.53,0:01:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵召集了一次晨会 他要您出席\N{\fnArial\fs30}The duke has called an early meeting of the council he wanted you to attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.43,0:01:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是今早\N{\fnArial\fs30}le matin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.64,0:01:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.70,0:01:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么法国人在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are the french here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是殿下要和您商量的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is what his grace wants to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.98,0:01:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死的法国佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}French bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦敦 白厅宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whiteball Palace London.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.41,0:02:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}佩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摩尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.More.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.41,0:02:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下要议会今天下午做简报\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty wants council this afternoon to be brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不想听到长篇大论\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't want a lot of speeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他正行私事 不可打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in seclusion and not to be disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.47,0:02:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.65,0:02:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您指的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}With regards to…?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.44,0:02:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我指的当然是意大利那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}With regard to italy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.71,0:02:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国佬在意大利所做的勾当\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the french are doing in italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.86,0:02:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里还能有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What other regard is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王殿下还在耐心的商讨此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty is counselling patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.47,0:02:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你是他的秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but you're his secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.18,0:02:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你每天都见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see him everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.30,0:03:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在私下 他非常悲伤不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}In private he's mad with grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几近心碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost inconsolable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你应当记住被谋杀的是他的叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you ought to remember it was his uncle they murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大臣们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.70,0:03:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在此紧要关头 我们需聚此商议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We meet to consider questions of great moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.71,0:03:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国国王已向世人展示了他侵略性的政策\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king of france has demonstrated to the world his aggressive policies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.84,0:03:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已侵入了5或6个意大利城邦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has already overrun 5 or 6 city states in italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对欧洲每个基督教国家来说 他都是个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a threat to every christian nation in europe,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.83,0:03:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他却又威胁教皇封他为信仰的卫冕者\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet he bullies the pope into declaring him defender of the faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.46,0:03:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除此之外 为了证明他无人能及的地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}On top of that, to prove that nobody can touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.31,0:03:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在乌尔比诺把我们的大使…\N{\fnArial\fs30}he has our ambassador in urbino…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.21,0:03:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是我的叔叔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my uncle…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谋杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此无情\N{\fnArial\fs30}In cold blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.51,0:04:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大臣们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信 这一切都是宣战的正当理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe these are all just causes for war!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下明言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty is certainly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.98,0:04:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您有充分的理由来发动战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have every reason to prosecute a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.13,0:04:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说实在的 我在一年前 就提醒过您法国人的野心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, I warned you a year ago about french ambitions,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.85,0:04:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次家门不幸才让陛下您相信我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}though has taken this personal tragedy for your majesty to accept my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.27,0:04:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诺福克公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norfolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.95,0:04:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同意白金汉阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree with my lord buckingham.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.68,0:04:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰之王历来便有权继承法国王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king of england has an ancient and historic right to the french throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.43,0:04:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却被瓦卢瓦家族篡夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}which the valois have usurped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是时候把他们赶下台\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is high time we kick them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们应当全力进攻法国\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should attack france with all our might.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.07,0:04:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么想的 沃尔西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What say you, wolsey?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:04:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同意国王陛下您的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I concur with your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些的确是… 正当理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are indeed, just causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.15,0:05:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it is settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.07,0:05:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将对法国开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are to war with france.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教阁下将做详细安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eminence will make all the arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.23,0:05:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以去玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can go play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.67,0:05:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真觉得我们该开战？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think we should go to war?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.36,0:05:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得我们应当按国王的心意行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should try to do what the king wants us to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果国王不明白怎样才是最佳措施呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the king doesn't know what's in his best interests?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样的话 你应当帮他决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, you should help him decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的丈夫怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的丈夫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.11,0:06:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嫉妒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's extremely jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他威胁说要散布谣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's threatening to make a scandal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说要把我丢进女修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says he'll put me in a nunnery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.36,0:07:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那可真是浪费\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be such a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里郡 汉普顿王宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hampton Court Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.49,0:07:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国大使阁下与波尼维主教来访\N{\fnArial\fs30}His excellency the french ambassador and bishop bonnivet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.06,0:07:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们 欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your excellency…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我国大使在乌尔比诺被残杀 实为不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happened in urbino, the butchering of our ambassador was most unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尤其对我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.55,0:07:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下应当知晓我对贵国的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your excellency is well aware of my sentiments towards your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.39,0:07:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为法国的利益不遗余力的奔走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have laboured long ad consistently in french interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这该如何解释？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how to explain this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.11,0:07:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谋杀我们国王的叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The matter of my king's uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.68,0:07:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坦白说 这不是我们国王的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly, it was not done on my master's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.19,0:08:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而犯下罪行的人业已处罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those that committed the crime have been punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 你得明白 我国并不将此事看得如此简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, now, you must understand, we are well beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利陛下血气方刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}King henry is a young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他向来好战 而且这次 他不会就此罢休\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has an appetite for war and on this occasion he will not be easy to appease.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.17,0:08:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然如此 那我们就开战吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, by all means let us have war.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.21,0:08:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恕我直言 您应该言非此意\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the greatest respect, you don't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.24,0:08:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信我们应当竭尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I believe that everything humanly possible should be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.23,0:08:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来避免两国之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}to avoid a war between our 2 countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}参与到「我们欧洲」的纠纷之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would do england no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.91,0:08:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对英格兰来说也是百害而无一利\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get involved in our european squabbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.03,0:08:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最好能置身乱世之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far better she stands above them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确信主教阁下有办法使年轻的狮子冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure your eminence has ways of pacifying the young lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}15比0\N{\fnArial\fs30}15-love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.86,0:09:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}30比0\N{\fnArial\fs30}30-love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们赢定了 安东尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our game, I think, anthony.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您知道我们是让着您赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty knows we're just lettin' you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.47,0:09:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实我在拼命打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I was playing as hard as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.59,0:09:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里有个人 我得去碰碰运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there is someone I have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看见了吗 中间走廊 蓝色裙子 面容精致纯洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, middle gallery, blue dress, that exquisite virginal face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.64,0:09:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}40比0 终场\N{\fnArial\fs30}40-love.Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是白金汉的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's buckingham's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.33,0:09:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}100克朗 你搞不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred crowns, you don't succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.03,0:09:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.59,0:10:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的女儿怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is our daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.87,0:10:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.28,0:10:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的老师说她天资颖慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know her tutors say she has exceptional talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.08,0:10:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尤其是在音乐上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially in music.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应当感到自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.11,0:10:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.38,0:10:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道的 凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I am, katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽是我的掌上明珠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary is the pearl of my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.26,0:10:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还没有给我的侄子回信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have not answered my nephew's letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.79,0:10:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就因为你的侄子是西班牙国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because your nephew's the king of spain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.59,0:10:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他觉得我除了给他写信 就没有其他重要的事情了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he think I have nothing better to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道他建议你和罗马帝国签订协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he advises you to sign a treaty with the emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将法国列为我们的共同敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}recognizing france as our mutual enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.61,0:10:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还建议你不要把沃尔西的话全都放在心上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also advises you not to heed everything wolsey tells you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.80,0:10:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为沃尔西对法国很偏爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}because wolsey is so biased with the french.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.85,0:10:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什么时候成外交家了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when are you a diplomat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有其父必有其女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am my father's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.17,0:11:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.65,0:11:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是我的部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not my minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.13,0:11:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是我的总理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not my chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.15,0:11:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就让我在各个方面都尽 为人妻的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should like to be your wife in every way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利 你还会不会像往常那样来我的卧房？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, will you not visit my bed chamber as you used to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.18,0:12:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}睡袍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gown.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.72,0:12:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:12:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳皇后在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the queen katherine?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:13:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇后陛下还在做祷告 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her majesty is still at prayer, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉皇后陛下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.87,0:13:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}身为她的丈夫 我来此献上 我对她的真情和职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to offer my love and devotion as her true husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.75,0:13:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天主圣母玛利亚 为我等罪人 今祈天主 及我等死候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy mary, mother of god, pray for us now and at the hour of our death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万福玛利亚 满被圣宠者 主与尔偕焉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hail mary, mother of grace, our lord is with thee blessed art.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.25,0:13:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女中尔为赞美 尔胎子耶稣并为赞美\N{\fnArial\fs30}thou amongst women and blessed is the fruit of thy womb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.89,0:14:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.67,0:14:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你愿意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you consent?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿意 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三分\N{\fnArial\fs30}3 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波特兰伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earl of portland!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:15:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯·布兰登阁下出场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Charles brandon has now entered the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.42,0:15:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesties.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白金汉小姐 你可愿让我今日承蒙你的恩惠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lady buckingham, would you do me the honour of letting me wear your favours today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.66,0:16:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈勒姆爵士挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord hallam challenges.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请带上头盔\N{\fnArial\fs30}A plaisance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}A terre!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.63,0:16:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯-布兰登阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Charles brandon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.53,0:16:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白金汉公爵陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}His grace the duke of buckingham will now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此刻将与纽卡斯尔伯爵进行马上长矛比斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}joust a plaisance with the earl of newcastle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}A terre!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵陛下又得三分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another 3 points for his grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教阁下可有计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does your eminence have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来避免战争？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A way to avoid war?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是新的和平协议的大纲\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the outline of a new peace treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}联合英法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uniting the english with the french.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.03,0:17:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可否？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.27,0:17:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要你带走细细详读\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to take it away and read it very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.40,0:17:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信这代表着外交界里的一些新事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe it represents something new in the world of diplomacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:18:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如贵王原则上同意 便可不失颜面的签署\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your king accepts it in principle he can sign it without any loss of face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.03,0:18:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说实话 他可欣喜庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, he can rejoice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.73,0:18:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的王可欣喜庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My master can rejoice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.41,0:18:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都可以欣喜庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can all rejoice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教阁下想要什么作为回报？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which case, what does your eminence want in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.02,0:18:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么都不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.52,0:18:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么都不要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从你身上 什么都不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想要的… 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I want, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有您能给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only you can give me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白金汉公爵重新进入场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The duke of buckingham has re-entered the lists.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.22,0:18:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已经赢了十回合\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's won 10 courses already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.49,0:18:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他想证明什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he trying to prove?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我来击败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想灭灭白金汉的威风\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to damage buckingham's pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下 国王已经出场\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords, the king has entered the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.51,0:19:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下来挑战？\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty makes the challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}la guerre.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.67,0:19:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管认输与否\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claim or no claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.18,0:19:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白金汉都不是国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buckingham's not the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是所有王公都像你那么忠诚 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of the court is as loyal as you charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.62,0:20:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}A terre!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.41,0:20:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下是今日胜者\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty wins the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.69,0:21:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.51,0:21:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}减速\N{\fnArial\fs30}And easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.59,0:21:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}立桨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Present oars!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.77,0:21:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.70,0:21:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.20,0:21:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.64,0:21:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的妻子 爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.06,0:21:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱丽丝 为国王殿下献吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, won't you kiss the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.23,0:21:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱丽丝女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.01,0:21:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.88,0:21:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们沿河散布 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we walk by the river, thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.70,0:21:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢步行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.16,0:22:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么不来宫里住？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why won't you come and live at court?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.26,0:22:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该知道才对 我不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know perfectly well why. I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.15,0:22:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的法律事业与我的生活都在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My legal practice and my life are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.24,0:22:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宫殿是给更有野心的人准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The court is for more ambitious men.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.14,0:22:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你上个月在议会上没怎么说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't say much in council last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.59,0:22:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.73,0:22:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和法国开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going to war with france.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.69,0:22:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为人道主义者 我痛恨战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a humanist I have an abhorrence of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.84,0:22:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}战争只适为兽行 执行者从来都不是野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an activity fit only for beasts yet practiced by no kind of beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.33,0:22:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反而都是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}so constantly as by man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.19,0:22:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为人道主义者 我与你同感\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a humanist I share your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.61,0:22:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为国王 我难以赞同\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a king I am forced to disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.49,0:22:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说得像个律师似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoken like a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.79,0:22:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道的 是你教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know.You taught me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.74,0:22:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来教的不够好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not well enough, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.24,0:22:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说完了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.64,0:22:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.10,0:22:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.55,0:22:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得劝告你 与其不惜任何代价开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must urge you that instead of spending ruinous amounts of money going to war,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.77,0:22:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不如用这些钱为人民谋福利\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should spend it rather, on the welfare of your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.13,0:23:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯 我向你发誓…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas, I swear to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.59,0:23:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要成为一名正直的统治者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to be a just ruler.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.31,0:23:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但告诉我：为何亨利五世被世人铭记？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tell me this: Why is henry v remembered?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.93,0:23:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他捐助大学和建救济所？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he endowed universities and built alm's houses for the destitute?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.96,0:23:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.61,0:23:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被铭记着是因为他赢了阿金库尔之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is remembered because he won the battle of agincourt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.71,0:23:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三千英格兰长弓手对六万法军\N{\fnArial\fs30}3000 english bowmen against 60000 frencH.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.70,0:23:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国的骑士精英在四小时之内被击溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flower of french chivalry destroyed in 4 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.89,0:23:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那场胜利让他成名 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That victory made him famous, thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.84,0:23:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他永垂不朽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It made him immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.45,0:23:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里任何一样都不是属于他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has no right to any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.09,0:23:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他父亲在战场上收缴了王冠\N{\fnArial\fs30}His father seized the crown on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.54,0:23:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不是靠他母氏家族的一个混蛋 他跟皇族还无瓜葛\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had no real claim to it, only through a bastard on his mother's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.91,0:23:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下的家族历史更悠久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace's family is more ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.41,0:23:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是爱德华二世的直系后裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a direct descendant of edward ii.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.25,0:23:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的王冠 这是我的宫殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my crown and this is my court.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.59,0:24:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是他的王冠 不是他的宫殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not his crown or his court.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.21,0:24:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您这可是叛国罪 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's treason, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.15,0:24:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.43,0:24:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}终有一天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one day…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.03,0:24:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会让其成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}we shall make it come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.51,0:24:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.53,0:24:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.77,0:24:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布兰登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brandon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.55,0:24:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来像什么就是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.65,0:24:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.15,0:25:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你强暴了我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You violated my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.54,0:25:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.84,0:25:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 她求我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she begged.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.58,0:25:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你夺走了她的清白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've taken her honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.25,0:25:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向你保证 阁下 有人已经捷足先登\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to your grace, someone else was there before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.14,0:25:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.49,0:25:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 那倒是真的 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that is true, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.59,0:25:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我该为此杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should kill you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.10,0:25:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.55,0:26:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人 布朗特女士来访\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eminence, lady blount is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.07,0:26:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.51,0:26:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.32,0:26:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能为你做点什么 布朗特女士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I dofor you, lady blount?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.62,0:26:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.99,0:26:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怀孕了 主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}with child, your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.70,0:26:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后呢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.60,0:26:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是陛下的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is his majesty's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.56,0:26:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.53,0:26:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.28,0:26:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你告诉国王了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you told the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.39,0:26:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.43,0:26:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.27,0:26:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会在合适的时候告诉陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will inform his majesty in due time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.37,0:27:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时你以生命发誓 不会对任何人说起来这事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the mean time you will say nothing to anybody on pain of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.11,0:27:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明白了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.28,0:27:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到你遮盖不住肚子的时候 你会被…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you are no longer able to hide your condition, you will be…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.92,0:27:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安排到一个隐蔽的地方修养\N{\fnArial\fs30}removed to a private place for your lying-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.46,0:27:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那里你可以生下你的小杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you can give birth to your bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.34,0:27:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.62,0:28:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您会为我病重的孩子祝福吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you bless my sick child?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.79,0:28:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人 求您倾听我的苦诉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eminence, please draw me an audience…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.35,0:28:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}各位 请为大人让路\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh my lords and masters, make way for his lord's grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.86,0:28:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.75,0:28:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 佩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, mr.Pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.63,0:28:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信你有在帮我谋福利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you are keeping a good eye on my interests?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.35,0:28:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是自然 主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.29,0:28:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像老鹰一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like an eagle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.44,0:28:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不要老鹰 佩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want an eagle, mr.Pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.48,0:28:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们飞的太高\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can soar too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.61,0:28:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要像鸽子 什么都盯着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a pigeon, shit on everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.13,0:28:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 主教阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.50,0:28:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.96,0:28:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外出狩猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.77,0:28:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 这让他心情顺畅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. It keeps him in good humour.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.83,0:28:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回来之后禀报一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send word when he returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.35,0:28:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.21,0:28:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.59,0:29:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.17,0:29:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有一封介绍信 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have letters of introduction sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.01,0:29:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是坎特伯雷教堂的教长写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these are from the dean of canterbury cathedral!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.42,0:29:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.85,0:29:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以自己引荐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you not present yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.50,0:30:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯·塔利斯（16世纪英国作曲家）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas tallis.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.40,0:30:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.65,0:30:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这上面说 你能演奏风琴 还有长笛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can play, it says, the organ and the flute.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.99,0:30:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且歌唱得也还算不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}and can sing more than moderately well.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.51,0:30:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有其它的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.60,0:30:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, siR.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.45,0:30:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我略懂作曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I compose a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.14,0:30:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.58,0:30:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.95,0:30:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教长能否赏识你的才华\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the dean commends your talents…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.01,0:30:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还是拭目以待的好 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we shall have to see, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.04,0:30:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.83,0:30:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信陛下今天狩猎很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust your majesty enjoyed hunting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.65,0:30:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备得怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are the preparations going?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.37,0:30:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.92,0:30:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的军队和舰队正在集结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both your army and fleet are assembling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.35,0:31:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}食物和武器供给正在准备中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stores and provisions are being laid in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.17,0:31:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几周之内您就可以宣战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could go to war in a matter of weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.13,0:31:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.79,0:31:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道这些琐事可以托付于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I could depend on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.51,0:31:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不胜感激 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am grateful to your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.43,0:31:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.85,0:31:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 战争会耗费大量财力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty, wars are expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.61,0:31:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您不得不提高税收来支付开销\N{\fnArial\fs30}To pay for them you have to raise taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.51,0:31:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不得民心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not always popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.20,0:31:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下可以采取其他手段 来赢得权利和声望\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if your majesty could gain more power and prestige by other means?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.56,0:31:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他手段？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other means?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.77,0:31:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和平手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaceful means.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.48,0:31:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.91,0:31:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有战争？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No battles?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.49,0:31:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有荣耀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No glory?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.73,0:31:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得陛下应该听他说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think your majesty should hear him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.67,0:31:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在过去的几周内 我代表陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the past few weeks, I have conducted, on your majesty's behalf,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.07,0:31:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开展了一轮深入而激烈的外交磋商\N{\fnArial\fs30}an intense round of diplomatic talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.54,0:32:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不仅和法国大使 还有帝国皇帝的代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just with the french ambassador but also with representatives of the emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.57,0:32:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丹麦 葡萄牙 意大利联邦的特使…\N{\fnArial\fs30}with envoys from denmark, portugal, the italian states…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.14,0:32:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么目的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what for?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.90,0:32:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}制定一项条约\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make a treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.61,0:32:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么样的条约？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of treaty?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.26,0:32:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万邦永久和平条约\N{\fnArial\fs30}A treaty of universal and perpetual peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.26,0:32:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎样实现？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it to be effected?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.64,0:32:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}分几个阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}In several stages.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.85,0:32:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先 会举行一个会晤\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the first place there would be a summit meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.21,0:32:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国国王和英格兰国王之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}between the kings of france and england.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.06,0:32:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首脑会议议程之一 陛下的女儿 将会被正式许配给法国皇太子\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the summit, your majesty's daughter would be betrothed fory to the french dauphin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.40,0:32:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会议结束的时候 您们都会签署条约\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at the end of the summit, you would both sign the treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.68,0:32:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这项条约在欧洲历史上前所未有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The treaty is entirely new in the history of europe,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.90,0:32:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确保全体签约国\N{\fnArial\fs30}committing all its signatories.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.04,0:32:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之间的安全与和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the principles of collective security and universal peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.98,0:32:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎样执行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would it be enforced?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.58,0:32:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果任何签约国受到侵略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should any of the signatory countries suffer aggression,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.17,0:32:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他签约国将会立即要求侵略者撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the others would immediately demand that the aggressor withdraws.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.56,0:33:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他们拒绝 其他签约国将会在一个月内对其宣战…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he refuses, within 1 month the rest would declare against him…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.74,0:33:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到恢复和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}and continue until peace is restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.26,0:33:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}条约也勾画了一个泛欧共和体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The treaty also envisages the creation of pan-european institutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.96,0:33:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在某种程度上 我喜欢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}In some ways I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.39,0:33:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认同它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recognize it…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.42,0:33:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也认同 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}so do you, thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.30,0:33:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.02,0:33:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将人道主义法则应用于国际事务中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the application of humanist principles to international affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.48,0:33:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恭喜主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eminence is to be congratulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.86,0:33:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是来寻求赞赏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't seek praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.72,0:33:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下将会被铭记为 一个崭新的现代世界的蓝图设计师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty would be known as the architect of a new and modern world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.97,0:33:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样我已心满意足\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be reward enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.22,0:33:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你我永远肝胆相照\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always, be assured of our love.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.73,0:34:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.59,0:34:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.76,0:34:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 白金汉公爵坚持求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty, the duke of buckingham insists upon an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.30,0:34:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.36,0:34:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下应该已经耳闻 我逮到查尔斯-布兰登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty ought to be made aware that I have discovered mr.Charles brandon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.50,0:34:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}轻薄我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}in flagrante delicto with my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.57,0:34:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布兰登阁下使我的家族蒙羞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Brandon has brought shame to my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.02,0:34:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要求陛下将他驱逐出宫廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I demand that your majesty banish him from court.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.30,0:34:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且处以其它陛下觉得合适的处罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}with whatever other punishment your majesty sees fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.87,0:34:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会有处罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.00,0:34:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非您女儿控告布兰登先生强奸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless your daughter accuses mr.Brandon of rape.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.26,0:34:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她有此控诉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she so claim?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.16,0:34:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您女儿控告布兰登先生强奸她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does your daughter claim mr.Brandon raped her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.50,0:34:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.40,0:34:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是对我个人和我的家族的冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The offence is against me and against my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.92,0:34:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我所知 没有什么冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I know, there has been no offence.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.30,0:34:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以也没必要处罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there is no need for any punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.07,0:35:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.80,0:35:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.49,0:35:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心白金汉公爵 亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful of buckingham, harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.82,0:35:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可能很傻 但他比你富有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may well be stupid, but he's richer than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.99,0:35:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有能力召集起一支私人军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}, and he can call upon a private army.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.34,0:35:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您父亲都没有顶撞过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even your father crossed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.20,0:35:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我非常高兴法国国王同意签署条约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very happy that the king of france has agreed to sign the treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.88,0:35:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且愿意主办首脑会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to host the summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.33,0:35:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下非常高兴能够避免开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty is delighted there will be no war.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.01,0:35:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们大家都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As we all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.81,0:35:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们之前讨论的另外一件事呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the other matter we discussed?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.25,0:35:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪一件 主教大人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which other matter, your eminence?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.37,0:35:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我帮过你家主子大忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved your master's arse.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.67,0:35:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我想要回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I want my reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.36,0:36:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能够安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can arrange it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.78,0:36:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听明白了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.47,0:36:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.54,0:36:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在被粗鲁地打断之前进行到哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where were we when we were so rudely interrupted?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.61,0:36:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.34,0:36:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不该这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}we shouldn'T.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.21,0:36:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我父亲会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.63,0:37:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我也将含笑上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I shall die a happy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.72,0:37:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.52,0:37:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们都读完了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}have you all finished your reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.62,0:37:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.03,0:37:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.91,0:37:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.30,0:37:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.38,0:37:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿上帝和天使保佑你们 今晚与你们作伴 直到永久\N{\fnArial\fs30}May god and his angels bless you and keep you this night and always.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.48,0:37:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.56,0:37:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight children.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.53,0:37:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.82,0:38:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 给弗朗西斯国王的信 该如何下笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The letter to king francis, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.88,0:38:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的高贵的表弟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dearest royal cousin…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.57,0:38:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.53,0:38:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}改成我心爱的表弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make that my beloved cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.54,0:38:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}致以我们的爱意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We send you our love.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.21,0:38:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们爱你之深 无从更深\N{\fnArial\fs30}We love you so much it would be impossible to love you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.71,0:38:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把一切安排妥当 好让我们能当面谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make all the necessary arrangements so we may meet face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.58,0:39:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在没有其它比这万邦和平条约 更贴近我心 更珍贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is now closer or more dear to my heart than this treaty of universal peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.55,0:39:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为我美好的意愿 以及对此条约的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a token of my good will, my commitment to this treaty,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.66,0:39:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有我对陛下的爱意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my love for your majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.14,0:39:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我决定…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have decided…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.80,0:39:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我决定…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have decided…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.47,0:39:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes, majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.44,0:39:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我决定在我们见面之前不会再剃胡须\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have decided I will not shave again until we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.05,0:39:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的胡须将成为我们之间友谊 爱意\N{\fnArial\fs30}My beard will be a token of universal friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.74,0:39:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the love between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.37,0:39:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.93,0:39:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.34,0:39:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有些消息给您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have some news for your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.15,0:40:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亚历山大教皇陛下 已经病入膏肓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His holiness, pope alexander, is desperately ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.27,0:40:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离归西不久已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It cannot be long before he is summoned to god's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.23,0:40:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}考虑到主教大人众所周知的虔诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}In view of your eminence's well-known piety,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.64,0:40:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及您渊博的学识和高超的外交手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as your great learning and diplomatic skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.04,0:40:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保证主教大人在选举教宗的 枢机主教团秘密会议上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure your eminence of the support of the french cardinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.47,0:40:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会得到法国红衣主教们的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the conclave to elect a successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.56,0:40:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再加上您属下红衣主教们的选票\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the votes of your own cardinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.81,0:40:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果上帝也许可 您将成为新任教宗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if it is pleasing to god you will be elected pope,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.71,0:40:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马主教 我们的新任圣父\N{\fnArial\fs30}bishop of rome our new holy father.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.44,0:40:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.27,0:40:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您让我觉得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make me feel…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.54,0:40:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常卑微\N{\fnArial\fs30}truly humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.48,0:41:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您病了吗 布朗特女士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ill, lady blount?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.09,0:41:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.17,0:41:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请留一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.75,0:41:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.37,0:41:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.27,0:41:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很久没和人谈过心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not talked to anyone for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.26,0:41:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}红衣主教沃尔西 遣散了我的西班牙神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cardinal wolsey dismissed my spanish confessor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.44,0:41:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和大部分西班牙侍女 以防他们是间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}and most of my spanish ladies in case they were spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.45,0:41:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我又无法信任英国神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I cannot trust my english confessor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.91,0:42:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我能信任你 我可以信任你吗 布朗特夫人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can trust you though, can I not, lady blount?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.15,0:42:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.01,0:42:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我悲从何来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is my sadness?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.65,0:42:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is that I…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.43,0:42:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无法给国王一个活着的子嗣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot give the king a living son.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.23,0:42:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾生过一个小男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave birth to a baby boy once.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.68,0:42:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可爱的男孩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sweet boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.20,0:42:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他死了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he died…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.30,0:42:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死在我怀里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my arms…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.41,0:42:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}活了仅仅4周\N{\fnArial\fs30}after just 4 weeks of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.14,0:42:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王怪罪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king blames me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.06,0:42:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.97,0:42:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他认定都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks it all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.65,0:42:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不知道我受了多大折磨 做了多少祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does not know how much I suffer, how much I pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.44,0:42:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直想起兄长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking about my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.48,0:43:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亚瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.72,0:43:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他死去时 我被注定要娶凯瑟琳为妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he died it was decided that I should marry katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.31,0:43:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是父亲不愿失去她继承的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think my father didn't want to lose her dowry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.25,0:43:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是跟西班牙联姻…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the prestige…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.51,0:43:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带来的威望\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a spanish marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.92,0:43:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论如何…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any case…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.45,0:43:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳发誓她跟兄长不曾圆房\N{\fnArial\fs30}katherine swore the marriage was never consummated.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.87,0:43:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此教皇准许了婚姻解除\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why a papal dispensation was granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.41,0:43:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此我娶了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so I married her.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.91,0:43:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从那时开始 我们有过5个夭折的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since then we have had 5 still-born children.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.49,0:43:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个男孩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.11,0:43:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只活了26天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}who lived for 26 days…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.22,0:44:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和唯独活下来的一个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a single living daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.38,0:44:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他们已经圆房了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if their marriage was consummated?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.62,0:44:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她对上帝发誓过没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has sworn before god that it was not.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.76,0:44:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福音书里怎么说来着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it say in the gospels?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.78,0:44:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若男子娶其兄嫂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a man should marry his brother's wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.34,0:44:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.77,0:44:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「利未记」中说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In leviticus…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.56,0:44:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「若男子娶其兄嫂\N{\fnArial\fs30}it says: "If a man marries his brother's wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.16,0:44:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}二人至死不得后代「\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will die childless".
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.13,0:44:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可你有孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.46,0:44:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但不是儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not a son!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.33,0:44:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no son.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.85,0:44:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯·博林到访 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas boleyn, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.89,0:44:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.48,0:45:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望您没有觉得我的邀请过于冒失\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you didn't find my invitation presumptuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.11,0:45:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听说您从法国被召回了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you had been recalled from france.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.03,0:45:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我停留不久 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for a short while, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.07,0:45:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.24,0:45:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们告诉我您是出色的大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tell me you are an excellent ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.19,0:45:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管他们是谁 他们真友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, whoever they are, they are very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.63,0:45:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您来自古老的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come from an old family.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.30,0:45:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}论古老和庞大 远不及大人您的氏族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though not as ancient, nor as grand, as your grace'S.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.63,0:45:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王选择平民围绕他左右 无地位 无声望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king chooses to surround himself with commoners,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.03,0:45:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无血统 无头衔的下三九流\N{\fnArial\fs30}men of no distinction, new men, without pedigree or titles.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.37,0:45:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这对他王权有何帮助？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that help the prestige of his crown?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.48,0:45:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大人 我… - 他父亲用武力而非权利夺得了王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your grace, I - his father only acquired the crown by force not by right!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.62,0:45:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 没人愿意重返内战的暗无天日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace, no one wants to return to the evil days of civil war.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.26,0:45:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既成事实 回天乏力\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is done is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.88,0:45:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王即国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king is the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.06,0:45:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王即国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king is the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.84,0:45:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.74,0:46:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个有情人还有两个孩子的教士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man of the cloth with a mistress and two children.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.30,0:46:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会中意这个人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you like this fellow?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.14,0:46:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}决不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.72,0:46:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们下次再聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall talk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.37,0:46:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我讲讲法国国王 托马斯伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about king francis, sir thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.10,0:46:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他23岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is 23 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.86,0:46:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}高吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he tall?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.99,0:46:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.29,0:46:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但长得不匀称\N{\fnArial\fs30}But ill-proportioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.68,0:46:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}腿呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about his legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.03,0:46:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的小腿强壮吗 跟我的一样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are his calves strong, like mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.41,0:46:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 没人的小腿能比得上您的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, no one has calves like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.97,0:46:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他英俊吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.58,0:46:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会有些人这么觉得吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people might think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.68,0:47:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他自己当然是这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}He certainly thinks so himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.84,0:47:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他那么虚荣吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's vain?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.93,0:47:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 他是法国人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty, he's french!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.95,0:47:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的宫廷如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about his court?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.36,0:47:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她以道德松散 放荡淫乱闻名\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has a reputation for loose morals and licentiousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.31,0:47:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而就国王自己而言 这没什么好整顿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which the king, by his own behaviour, does nothing to dispel.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.56,0:47:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有两个女儿 托马斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have two daughters, sir thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.80,0:47:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么保护她们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you protect them?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.57,0:47:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直警惕着她们身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep a watchful eye on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.19,0:47:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但同时信任她们自有贞洁操守\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I also trust in their goodness and virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.55,0:47:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请你立即启程回巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will return immediately to paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.49,0:47:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我委托你代理一切首脑会议的外交谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am entrusting you with all the diplomatic negotiations for the summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.69,0:47:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.51,0:47:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.93,0:47:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.55,0:48:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.35,0:48:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁敢说你不美丽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.82,0:48:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你难道不是世上最美丽的女孩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you the most beautiful girl in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.69,0:48:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.65,0:48:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.86,0:48:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感觉怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.02,0:48:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.78,0:48:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.77,0:48:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papa's busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.11,0:48:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.46,0:48:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听大人的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do everything you are told.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.71,0:48:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以说句话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May we speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.33,0:48:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.18,0:48:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.13,0:48:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.16,0:48:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.76,0:48:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不喜欢什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What don't you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.44,0:48:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.94,0:48:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更不喜欢它的含义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor what it represents.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.84,0:48:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.56,0:48:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要把我女儿 送给法国和他们王太子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are giving my daughter away to the dauphin and to france.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.59,0:48:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至没有征求过我的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not even consult me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.67,0:49:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瓦卢瓦王朝是我氏族的死敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}The valois are the sworn enemies of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.06,0:49:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要按我认为恰当的方式安排她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is mine to do with as I see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.64,0:49:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是一场伟大的联姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a great marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.82,0:49:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道沃尔西就是幕后黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see wolsey's hand behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.93,0:49:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}纵使我深爱陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though I love your majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.93,0:49:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你忠贞不苟\N{\fnArial\fs30}and am loyal to you in every way,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.46,0:49:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不能掩饰我的忧伤与不快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot disguise my distress and unhappiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.93,0:49:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做不到也要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well you're going to have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.11,0:49:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国 巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paris, France.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.24,0:49:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早安 大使先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonjour monsieur l'ambassadeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.02,0:49:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有您一封要函\N{\fnArial\fs30}Il y a des messages pour vous.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.86,0:49:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王明天接见您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Et demain vous avez une audience avec le roi.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.93,0:49:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trbien.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.67,0:49:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 皮埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merci pierre.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.69,0:49:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的女儿们在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are my daughters?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.20,0:49:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有令人兴奋的好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have some exciting news.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.24,0:50:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯国王和亨利国王 将在加来市附近会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is to be a summit between king francis and king henry near calais.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.21,0:50:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我负责准备安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am to arrange it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.07,0:50:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}意味着你们姐妹俩 都有机会见到英国国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means you will both have the opportunity to meet the king of england!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.33,0:50:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.55,0:50:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有我的安妮 博林\N{\fnArial\fs30}And anne.Boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.97,0:50:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敬你们的将来\N{\fnArial\fs30}To your futures!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.07,0:50:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔西红衣主教到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His eminence cardinal wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.98,0:50:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要你的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.70,0:50:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}觉得这件衣裳如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like this cloth?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.66,0:50:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常适合陛下您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it suits your majesty very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.32,0:50:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请允许我建议 或许…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps, if I might suggest…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.46,0:50:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该配上这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}with these.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.53,0:50:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得弗朗西斯有这么精美的饰物吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think francis will have anything as fine as these?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.76,0:50:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有也是他偷来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if he steals them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.79,0:50:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.16,0:51:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们共餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's eat together.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.79,0:51:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}畅谈一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.91,0:51:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.56,0:51:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 你要道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace will apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.66,0:51:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said…!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.06,0:51:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.96,0:51:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果触犯了陛下您 我道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize if I have offended your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.95,0:51:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人你可以离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace may leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.54,0:51:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}侍者 给大法官拿双新鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, fetch the chancellor a new pair of shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.04,0:51:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍普金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.53,0:51:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍普金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.26,0:52:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.26,0:52:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.79,0:52:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.84,0:52:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.37,0:52:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首脑会议一切准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything is prepared for the summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.40,0:52:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地点在加来市范围 属英国领土\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will take place in the pale of calais, english territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.40,0:52:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在名为Val D'or的山谷中 意为黄金山谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a valley known as the val d'or, the valley of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.76,0:52:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千名工人为陛下您建造了一座宫殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thousand labourers have constructed a palace for your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.91,0:52:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被称为幻象之宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's known as the palace of illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.25,0:52:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人甚至称它为世界第8大奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some say it's the 8th wonder of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.36,0:52:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去买来所有能找到的金银\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to purchase as much cloth of gold and silver as you can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.94,0:52:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贿赂卫兵用它们再好不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a better thing to bribe the guards with.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.93,0:52:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.83,0:52:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后 我要你到我们的领地去 照之前讨论决定的来做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I want you to proceed to our estates and do as we discussed,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.85,0:52:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}制造些动乱 好让人以为 我们招兵买马是为了自卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}just making some noise that we're only raising men to defend ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.80,0:52:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.70,0:53:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布朗特夫人有了身孕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady blount is with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.79,0:53:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布朗特夫人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady blount?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.77,0:53:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若您想留下这婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to keep the child,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.62,0:53:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以安排她住到耶利哥的别馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will arrange for her to be moved to the house at jericho.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.04,0:53:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也会处理好她丈夫相关事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will also deal with her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.03,0:53:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我父亲…\N{\fnArial\fs30}my father…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.16,0:53:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾告诉我 他计划如何刺杀理查三世\N{\fnArial\fs30}once told me how he had planned to assassinate richard iii.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.41,0:53:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他把刀藏在衣服里 走到他面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would come before him with a knife secreted about his person.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.53,0:53:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.44,0:54:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都等不及首脑会议的举行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait for this summit!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.79,0:54:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它将永远改变世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll change the world forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.08,0:54:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我最由衷的希望 以及最坚定的信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is my dearest hope, and my ultimate belief.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.40,0:54:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}翻天覆地的变化即将发生 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing will ever be the same, your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.44,0:54:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你我将不朽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I will be immortal.
